<title>USA: Baker, Fentress sets distributions.</title>
<headline>Baker, Fentress sets distributions.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Baker, Fentress &amp; Co, a closed-end fund, said Thursday its year-end distributions would total $2.36 per share and consist of $1.78 from net realized long-term capital gains and $0.58 from net investment income and realized net short-term capital gains.</p>
<p>Payment will be made December 5, record November 15 on 32,402,520 shares.</p>
<p>The year-end dividend of $0.58 per share from net investment income and realized net short-term capital gain, added to the $0.20 per share mid-year dividend, results in 1996 ordinary income dividends of $0.78 per share.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
